  "body": "Add the verified registered screen magnetic curvature checkpoint to the existing HDblast project page. The text gives the signed selected coefficient, complete quadratic contribution, specified observers and angular zero set, while retaining the missing clock/gauge-invariance, full boundary-solution and physical-origin limitations.\n\nThe page update is additive and has a complete inverse-byte check. All other projects and existing shared-site files remain unchanged. No new Zenodo version or journal submission accompanies this checkpoint.\n",
